xt":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实未提供药物过量与给药错误管理的具体规则，允许来源中也无对应项目文件，无法形成可直接写入方案的实质正文。医学作者需在获得项目相关文件后补充该章节内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_bd1ccf6487d38384","section_number":"6.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:72de7c9d731fa2b2154d3bbf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922135508_ae194bef","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性\n匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"8a8968b8bb746ee91a2f1616a94f88b939e883d5252fdda08aada8b808fd91d5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_duration"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_intervention"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_adherence","span_duration","span_intervention"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充当前项目药品计数和受试者日记的具体操作要求、依从性计算规则及评价阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_5_adherence_ops","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗依从性评价细则或药物管理计划"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"},{"action":"补充受试者日记的发放、填写与回收要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_5_diary_handling","missing_source_classes":["受试者日记管理文件"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"}],"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗依从性评价细则（含药品计数与受试者日记的具体操作、计算方法和评价阈值）"],"proposal_text":"在16周双盲治疗期内，受试者按每日一次口服给药方案接受研究治疗，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg，对照组接受匹配安慰剂。研究治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价；试验组与对照组采用相同的依从性评价方式。药品计数和受试者日记是评价研究治疗依从性的两项依据。","rationale":"已确认研究事实明确双盲治疗期为16周，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服、对照组接受匹配安慰剂，且两组均通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。正文据此写入依从性评价方式；依从性计算规则、评价阈值及药品计数与受试者日记的具体操作要求待项目文件补充，医学作者需核对。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3edc6ed0268a0557","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:72de7c9d731fa2b2154d3bbf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922135508_ae194bef","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充当前项目合并用药/治疗的允许范围、禁限用药清单、记录及报告要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_6_concomitant_meds","missing_source_classes":["项目合并用药/治疗管理文件"],"target":"6.6 合并用药/治疗"}],"heading":"合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["当前项目合并用药/治疗管理规则文件","允许的合并用药、禁限用药及记录要求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实未提供合并用药/治疗的允许范围、禁限用药清单及记录要求，允许来源中也无对应项目文件，无法形成可直接写入方案的实质正文；仅在估计目标策略中提及使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答。医学作者需在获得项目相关文件后补充该章节内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_f2862d79759a5299","section_number":"6.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:72de7c9d731fa2b2154d3bbf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"e800064dc1ffdae25304180895952d64bb2b88c2233db9c95a9842d184fedb1c","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:72de